 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the options a causal substrate is drawn with at a given size"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"704f653f-5811-410a-b38b-e9f6b5f063cf"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
