 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the held code that builds a named causal substrate"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"9fc2e515-708f-4184-862d-913ee794fc43"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Random causal graphs", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"91aa1782-86a7-488d-980b-5c368a5bc1c0"],

Cell[TextData[{
